DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15588::$$$message_0121_0000_0000$$$::I'll hold back the urge to buy both tissues and toilet paper at the same time.[lr]::
15589::$$$message_0121_0000_0001$$$::It's not too heavy, but it would take up one hand.[lr]::
15590::$$$message_0121_0000_0002$$$::Plus, the war trophies from the grocery store and the butcher's are piled high in my arms.::
15591::$$$message_0121_0001_0000$$$::"...I should've brought someone along to help hold things."[lr]::
15592::$$$message_0121_0001_0001$$$::Rider is dependable when I have a lot of things to buy.[lr]::
15593::$$$message_0121_0001_0002$$$::...Although, there's the problem that she can carry so much that she gathers attention at times.::
15594::$$$message_0121_0002_0000$$$::"Well, at least I haven't gone to the tofu shop or rice shop."[lr]::
15595::$$$message_0121_0002_0001$$$::Those are heavy, so it makes me want a backpack.[lr]::
15596::$$$message_0121_0002_0002$$$::As I'm wondering why shopping for groceries is always like the postwar reconstruction period...::
15597::$$$message_0121_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15598::$$$message_0121_0003_0001$$$::Oh, there's a rare person in a rare place.[lr]::
15599::$$$message_0121_0003_0002$$$::Kane Himuro from class 3-A, also known as Miss Himuro.[lr]::
15600::$$$message_0121_0003_0003$$$::She's the high jump star on the track team and has this unique flair to her.[lr]::
15601::$$$message_0121_0003_0004$$$::She's looking over here.::
15602::$$$message_0121_0004_0000$$$::"Yo. What a coincidence, Himuro."[lr]::
15603::$$$message_0121_0004_0001$$$::"Good day. Come to think of it, this is your home range."[lr]::
15604::$$$message_0121_0004_0002$$$::I nod.[lr]::
15605::$$$message_0121_0004_0003$$$::Tohsaka tells me very strange things, like that Himuro has nothing ordinary about her, but she's ordinary.::
15606::$$$message_0121_0005_0000$$$::"I see, so the rumor seems to be true."[lr]::
15607::$$$message_0121_0005_0001$$$::"Huh, what kind of rumor?"[lr]::
15608::$$$message_0121_0005_0002$$$::"The sole rumor that you're a homemaker. Don't worry, the rumor has been going around since we were second-years."[lr]::
15609::$$$message_0121_0005_0003$$$::The way Himuro tells me this sounds as if she's trying to say that it's too late.[lr]::
15610::$$$message_0121_0005_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02a(中) textoff=0]...She's not wrong, but I feel like being the subject of that kind of rumor is beneath a man's dignity.::
15611::$$$message_0121_0006_0000$$$::"It's not wrong, but... I bet it's gonna turn into me raising a child eventually."[lr]::
15612::$$$message_0121_0006_0001$$$::"...I think it suits you."::
15613::$$$message_0121_0007_0000$$$::"For example, Yukika is a good person that takes care of her little brother often.[lr]::
15614::$$$message_0121_0007_0001$$$::You're also a good person, so you must be good at taking care of kids too."[lr]::
15615::$$$message_0121_0007_0002$$$::"...I'm the same as Saegusa, huh..."[lr]::
15616::$$$message_0121_0007_0003$$$::The track club trio of Himuro, Saegusa, and that Makidera.[lr]::
15617::$$$message_0121_0007_0004$$$::There's a problem with the ringleader, but her friend, Saegusa, is a guaranteed good girl.::
15618::$$$message_0121_0008_0000$$$::"So, are you shopping, Emiya? You're working hard."[lr]::
15619::$$$message_0121_0008_0001$$$::"I have a lot of mouths to feed, so we won't make it on time unless we all go shopping."[lr]::
15620::$$$message_0121_0008_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01d(中) textoff=0]There's usually three people and when it increases, it becomes six people at most.[lr]::
15621::$$$message_0121_0008_0003$$$::I need a strategic way to shop unlike the past.::
15622::$$$message_0121_0009_0000$$$::"There's that many mouths to feed at your place?"[lr]::
15623::$$$message_0121_0009_0001$$$::"Yeah. Plus, there's about three that eat quite a lot."[lr]::
15624::$$$message_0121_0009_0002$$$::I decide not to reveal their names for the sake of their reputation.::
15625::$$$message_0121_0010_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=400][chgfg storage=氷室私服01b(中) time=300 textoff=0][say storage=cty0316_him_0070 name=氷室]Let me just ask, how many cups of rice do you cook at a time?"[lr]::
15626::$$$message_0121_0010_0001$$$::"Umm, seven cups."[lr]::
15627::$$$message_0121_0010_0002$$$::We have to make lunch, so I easily cook that much.[lr]::
15628::$$$message_0121_0010_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02e(中) textoff=0]I mean, that's a normal amount for six people... Wait, why is she looking at me with so much pity?::
15629::$$$message_0121_0011_0000$$$::"Is your house a training camp?"[lr]::
15630::$$$message_0121_0011_0001$$$::"It's something like that. A lot of people started living there before I'd even realized."[lr]::
15631::$$$message_0121_0011_0002$$$::"So you're feeding all of them. That's a lot of work."[lr]::
15632::$$$message_0121_0011_0003$$$::"It's a lot easier than only making my food."::
15633::$$$message_0121_0012_0000$$$::In the past, I would be eating by myself when Fuji-nee and Kiritsugu weren't home.[lr]::
15634::$$$message_0121_0012_0001$$$::Compared to that blandness, it's much better when it's lively.::
15635::$$$message_0121_0013_0000$$$::"So, are you also shopping? Do you cook?"[lr]::
15636::$$$message_0121_0013_0001$$$::"...Hm. Which one should I answer first?"[lr]::
15637::$$$message_0121_0013_0002$$$::"Then, cooking first."::
15638::$$$message_0121_0014_0000$$$::"...It's not like I can't, but I am not good. Sadly enough, my skills are even worse than Makidera's."[lr]::
15639::$$$message_0121_0014_0001$$$::"Wow, that's unexpected. Actually, it's more unexpected that Makidera cooks."[lr]::
15640::$$$message_0121_0014_0002$$$::"Despite how she looks, Kaede is detail-oriented. She's the type to work hard once she gets someone to devote herself to."::
15641::$$$message_0121_0015_0000$$$::[font italic=true]Wow.[font italic=false][lr]::
15642::$$$message_0121_0015_0001$$$::To think that the beast of Homurahara, who could aim to be Fuji-nee the Second, had that kind of hidden side to her.[lr]::
15643::$$$message_0121_0015_0002$$$::Well, I don't think that will ever have anything to do with me.::
15644::$$$message_0121_0016_0000$$$::"And the second one. You asked if I was shopping, but you guessed wrong. It's a nice day out, so I am just taking a stroll."[lr]::
15645::$$$message_0121_0016_0001$$$::"Oh really? That's rare."[lr]::
15646::$$$message_0121_0016_0002$$$::"Are you referring to me taking a walk? Or me running into you?"[lr]::
15647::$$$message_0121_0016_0003$$$::She interjects without giving me any time to take a breath.[lr]::
15648::$$$message_0121_0016_0004$$$::It's very much like Himuro to shoot off rapid-fire questions without needing to pause.::
15649::$$$message_0121_0017_0000$$$::"Both. To run into you alone, and I also didn't imagine you would take a walk if the weather is nice out."[lr]::
15650::$$$message_0121_0017_0001$$$::"Thought so. I admit myself that it's rare for me to get out of my apartment without any purpose. I must've gotten into the mood where not having any purpose is my purpose once in a while."::
15651::$$$message_0121_0018_0000$$$::Himuro starts walking around.[lr]::
15652::$$$message_0121_0018_0001$$$::I haven't finished shopping yet, but my legs go after Himuro.::
15653::$$$message_0121_0019_0000$$$::"...Are you okay with this, Emiya?"[lr]::
15654::$$$message_0121_0019_0001$$$::"With what?"[lr]::
15655::$$$message_0121_0019_0002$$$::"You're in the middle of shopping, right? I'm asking whether it's fine for you to follow someone who just has a lot of time on her hands when you're carrying all that heavy stuff."[lr]::
15656::$$$message_0121_0019_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01c(中) textoff=0]Either she's worried about me, or she's coldly getting mad at me.[lr]::
15657::$$$message_0121_0019_0004$$$::Unlike the Tohsaka from the past who was difficult to approach because she was polite on the outside but actually rude, Himuro's bluntness is innate.::
15658::$$$message_0121_0020_0000$$$::"I finished shopping for the most part. This is part of the way home."[lr]::
15659::$$$message_0121_0020_0001$$$::"Then that's good, but unfortunately, I will be parting with you here."[lr]::
15660::$$$message_0121_0020_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02d(中) textoff=0]She glances in the direction of a swing set.[lr]::
15661::$$$message_0121_0020_0003$$$::The vacant seat in the air sways.::
15662::$$$message_0121_0021_0000$$$::"I wouldn't think that there's any kind of sweet topic to talk about while sitting next to each other on the swings."[lr]::
15663::$$$message_0121_0021_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]Wh...at...!?"[lr]::
15664::$$$message_0121_0021_0002$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=800][say storage=cty0316_him_0200 name=氷室]You seem to be hurt just like anyone else. Did my statement warrant such an overexaggerated reaction?"[lr]::
15665::$$$message_0121_0021_0003$$$::Himuro quietly asks me awkwardly.[lr]::
15666::$$$message_0121_0021_0004$$$::[font italic=true]Was that Himuro's way of making a joke just now...?[font italic=false]::
15667::$$$message_0121_0022_0000$$$::"My bad, I couldn't think of a comeback.[lr]::
15668::$$$message_0121_0022_0001$$$::Yeah, whether or not we have sweet things to talk about, we can at least talk on the bench."[lr]::
15669::$$$message_0121_0022_0002$$$::"Mrgh... I guess the swings were too romantic.[lr]::
15670::$$$message_0121_0022_0003$$$::Sorry, I'll keep that in mind."[lr]::
15671::$$$message_0121_0022_0004$$$::Himuro quickly gets away from the swings.[lr]::
15672::$$$message_0121_0022_0005$$$::[font italic=true]...Wait.[font italic=false][lr]::
15673::$$$message_0121_0022_0006$$$::[font italic=true]Maybe that wasn't a joke after all...?[font italic=false]::
15674::$$$message_0121_0023_0000$$$::"Let's change the subject.[lr]::
15675::$$$message_0121_0023_0001$$$::...This is a trivial conversation, but it's your fault for following me. Can you listen to me talk to myself for a bit?" [lr]::
15676::$$$message_0121_0023_0002$$$::"What... Oh, yeah, if you're okay with me being here."[lr]::
15677::$$$message_0121_0023_0003$$$::I fix my posture.[lr]::
15678::$$$message_0121_0023_0004$$$::I accidentally made fun of her, so it's the least sincerity I can show.::
15679::$$$message_0121_0024_0000$$$::"Thank you for listening.[lr]::
15680::$$$message_0121_0024_0001$$$::But even then, it's not a big deal. It's simply the question of what on earth happened to myself for acting on such a whim?[lr]::
15681::$$$message_0121_0024_0002$$$::It's like...[wvl canskip=0 time=500]am I really the person I was yesterday? [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Or such."::
15682::$$$message_0121_0025_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15683::$$$message_0121_0025_0001$$$::...She says some interesting things.[lr]::
15684::$$$message_0121_0025_0002$$$::There are people who questioned this situation, but there aren't many who'd question the people they were yesterday.[lr]::
15685::$$$message_0121_0025_0003$$$::"...Wow. Is there some abnormality that can't be expressed and can't be seen with the human eye or something?"::
15686::$$$message_0121_0026_0000$$$::"An abnormality... [cacheimage storage=氷室私服01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中)]Yes, that is correct.[lr]::
15687::$$$message_0121_0026_0001$$$::I have the impression that I can remember what happened up until yesterday, but it is slightly different. But the basis is the same, so there's no way that would cause problems.[lr]::
15688::$$$message_0121_0026_0002$$$::That's why maybe I'm the one that changed. I thought that when I woke up this morning."[lr]::
15689::$$$message_0121_0026_0003$$$::"...It's like you turned into a caterpillar once you woke up."::
15690::$$$message_0121_0027_0000$$$::"I don't think I'm that sensitive.[lr]::
15691::$$$message_0121_0027_0001$$$::...Besides, it's not visible to the human eye, but I can express it in words. I can clearly tell what is abnormal."::
15692::$$$message_0121_0028_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15693::$$$message_0121_0028_0001$$$::That's a surprise.[lr]::
15694::$$$message_0121_0028_0002$$$::The abnormality is an abnormality, since it can't be grasped.[lr]::
15695::$$$message_0121_0028_0003$$$::It seems like she can express what's different in words.::
15696::$$$message_0121_0029_0000$$$::"Like what?"[lr]::
15697::$$$message_0121_0029_0001$$$::"That is...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]um, it's very hard to say, but...[lr]::
15698::$$$message_0121_0029_0002$$$::Hey, Emiya. Were we able to talk this comfortably? I-In fact like, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]see what I mean, [wvl canskip=0 time=500]you know."[lr]::
15699::$$$message_0121_0029_0003$$$::Like lovers.[lr]::
15700::$$$message_0121_0029_0004$$$::Miss Himuro murmurs.::
15701::$$$message_0121_0030_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
15702::$$$message_0121_0030_0001$$$::My consciousness that was nervous loosens up all of a sudden and crumbles.[lr]::
15703::$$$message_0121_0030_0002$$$::This is rude to the girl in front of me, but surpassing feelings of surprise, I couldn't help but admire the power of the girl's girlishness.::
15704::$$$message_0121_0031_0000$$$::"W-What, why are you covering your mouth?[lr]::
15705::$$$message_0121_0031_0001$$$::I'm talking about serious stuff, I didn't say anything funny!"[lr]::
15706::$$$message_0121_0031_0002$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-2]Ha, no, haha, that's not it, I'm not laughing [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=-3]because it was funny."[lr]::
15707::$$$message_0121_0031_0003$$$::I want to seriously applaud Himuro.::
15708::$$$message_0121_0032_0000$$$::"...Never mind, it was foolish of me to talk to you.[lr]::
15709::$$$message_0121_0032_0001$$$::Emiya, forget about me immediately and continue shopping for the mouths you have to feed.[lr]::
15710::$$$message_0121_0032_0002$$$::I will stop doing things that are out of character and shall go back to my Semina Apartment."::
15711::$$$message_0121_0033_0000$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
15712::$$$message_0121_0033_0001$$$::I don't even have the time to hold her back.[lr]::
15713::$$$message_0121_0033_0002$$$::Himuro runs to the exit of the park with as much force as Makidera. Actually, it's more like she's walking.::
15714::$$$message_0121_0034_0000$$$::"Well then, good day.[lr]::
15715::$$$message_0121_0034_0001$$$::I have decided to follow Kaede's lead from this incident. You shall think that your enemy has turned into two people from now on."[lr]::
15716::$$$message_0121_0034_0002$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Guh. All right, it was my bad! Hey, hold on, Himuro!"[lr]::
15717::$$$message_0121_0034_0003$$$::"What is done cannot be undone. Goodbye, Emiya."::
15718::$$$message_0121_0035_0000$$$::Kane Himuro leaves at the speed of a moving vehicle even while walking.[lr]::
15719::$$$message_0121_0035_0001$$$::...I screwed up.[lr]::
15720::$$$message_0121_0035_0002$$$::It was interesting, so I wanted to hear more.::

